# Template for op.env (see the Secrets section of CLAUDE.md).
#
# Copy to op.env, which is gitignored, and run commands that need a credential
# with:   op run --env-file=op.env -- <cmd>
# Each line is an env var name and an op://<vault>/<item>/<field> reference,
# never a literal value. Items are named <repo>-<service>.
#
# This repo currently has no credential that is needed locally. Its one secret
# is CI-only (a GitHub Actions secret on the repo, used by release.yml), listed
# here for the inventory; uncomment it only if you run goreleaser's tap push
# from a workstation.
#HOMEBREW_TAP_GITHUB_TOKEN=op://<vault>/wyk-homebrew-tap/HOMEBREW_TAP_GITHUB_TOKEN
